{
  "description": "Add support for SiriusDB, a GPU-native SQL engine that accelerates analytical queries\nby offloading execution to graphics processors via DuckDB integration.\n\nSiriusDB is notable for:\n- 10x faster than DuckDB, 60x faster than ClickHouse at same hardware cost\n- Integrates with DuckDB via Substrait query format\n- Built on NVIDIA CUDA-X libraries (cuDF)\n- Plug-and-play with CPU fallback when GPU unavailable\n- Ideal for TPC benchmark acceleration\n\nReference: https://www.sirius-db.com, https://github.com/sirius-db/sirius\n",
